        <!-- <include file='AppData/XmlDoc/TngnWsvc.xml' path='TngnWsvc/Class[@name="Project"]/About/*'/> -->
        <About>
            <note type="information" title="About the Tingen Web Service">
                Netsmart's <see href="https://www.ntst.com/Solutions-and-Services/Offerings/myAvatar">AvatarNX™</see> is a
                behavioral health Electronic Health Records application that offers a recovery-focused suite of
                solutions that leverage real-time analytics and clinical decision support to drive value-based care.<br/>
                <br/>
                While AvatarNX™ is a robust platform, it isn't perfect. The good news is that you can extend AvatarNX™
                functionality via Netsmart's Web Services and/or <i>custom web services</i> that are written by other
                AvatarNX™ users.<br/>
                <br/>
                The <b>Tingen Web Service</b> is one such custom web service which includes various tools and utilities for
                AvatarNX™ that aren't included in the official release, and provides a solid foundation for building
                additional functionality quickly and efficiently.<br/>
                <br/>
                Please see the Tingen Web
                Service <see href="https://github.com/spectrum-health-systems/Tingen-WebService">GitHub repository</see> for more information.
            </note>
        </About>

